Frequently asked questions

What does BeTranslated do?

We provide professional translation for businesses, legal teams and individuals. You can use us for documents, websites and specialist content. We work with clients in the UK, Europe and worldwide.

Who works on my translation?

A project manager looks after your order from request to delivery. A professional linguist who speaks the target language as a native handles the translation. You always have one person to ask about progress.

Do you offer certified translations for UK use?

Yes. We can supply a signed statement confirming the translation is complete and accurate. Tell us who will receive it, such as the Home Office, a court or a university. We then follow the format they require.

Do you work with small and medium companies?

Yes. Small and medium companies are a large part of our work. We scale our support to your project, from a single document to ongoing content. Tell us what you need and we will suggest a sensible approach.

How do I request a quote?

Send us your files and tell us the languages, purpose and deadline. We review everything and reply with a clear quote. The quote is free and carries no obligation.
